\nmodal overlay with an `elevation=\"overlay\"` panel and CSS transitions), it supports sidebar\nnavigation and bottom sheets."},"525":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."},"526":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Use `<DrawerTrigger>` to wrap a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`. The drawer opens when the trigger is pressed."},"527":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Use `placement=\"bottom\"` with controlled state for a bottom sheet pattern. Compose a\n`CloseButton` for the dismiss affordance."},"528":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"The drawer slides in from whichever edge you set with `placement`."},"529":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Popovers rendered inside a drawer stay open without dismissing the drawer."},"530":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"Use `isKeyboardDismissDisabled` to prevent the drawer from being dismissed by the escape key."},"531":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"When the content is taller than the drawer, the `Content` region scrolls while the title row\nstays pinned."},"532":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],